# A station's file sent as a file (StationFiles.kt RefCard, openRefSheet, sendUp): ＋ → Station 文件, a file of the lent
# folder ticked, 添加; its card tapped: its sheet, 发送方式 文件: staged on the chat's own station (drive.stage), the card
# says its size once up; sent with words: the message carries it as an attachment, not its path.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap icon:plus
until Station 文件
tap Station 文件
until =e2e-{T}
tap =e2e-{T}
until 小说-e2e.txt
tap 小说-e2e.txt
until 添加 1 个
tap 添加 1 个
gone 所有位置
until studio · 路径
tap 小说-e2e.txt
until 发送方式
shot 1-sheet
tap =文件
until 此对话默认发送文件
shot 2-file
tapxy 195 120
gone 发送方式
until KB
shot 3-card
tap 发消息
type 作为文件发送 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
until 作为文件发送 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 4-sent
